    "完成后可直接预览、分享，或在「我的文件」中再次打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When it's done, preview or share right away, or open it again in My Files"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对准发送端动画码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aim at the sender's animated code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对方用支持 cimbar 的发送端，本机扫一扫即可": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other device shows a cimbar code — just scan it with this one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除「%@」，无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” will be deleted. This can’t be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将同步重命名磁盘上的文件，分享与「文件」App 中一致；扩展名保持不变": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This also renames the file on disk, so the same name appears when sharing and in the Files app. The file extension stays unchanged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
