          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Received"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接收的数据无法解压（错误 %d），可能是传输受损": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Received data couldn't be decompressed (error %d) — the transfer may be corrupted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接收超过 30 天的文件会被自动清理（切换后立即生效，并在每次启动时检查）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files received more than 30 days ago are cleaned up automatically (takes effect immediately and on every launch)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接收超过 7 天的文件会被自动清理（切换后立即生效，并在每次启动时检查）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files received more than 7 days ago are cleaned up automatically (takes effect immediately and on every launch)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "搜索文件名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search files"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "操作不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This action cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持任意文件类型：图片、文档、压缩包等": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any file type: photos, documents, archives, and more"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数据不上传服务器，文件只在你的设备上": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing goes to a server — your files stay on your device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件保存在 App 的文档目录，可在系统「文件」App 中浏览。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files are saved to this app's Documents folder and can be browsed in the Files app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
