    "本应用使用 libcimbar 开源项目（Mozilla Public License 2.0）实现解码链路，包含少量适配 iOS 的修改；修改后的源文件依 MPL-2.0 以源代码形式提供。详细的开源声明请见「开源许可」页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app uses the libcimbar open-source project (Mozilla Public License 2.0) for its decoding pipeline, with minor modifications for iOS. The modified source files are made available in source form under MPL-2.0. See the Open Source Licenses page for details."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用是由第三方开发的非官方客户端，与 libcimbar 开源项目及 cimbar.org 无隶属或合作关系。": {
      "localizations": {
