    "萤传": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "萤传是一款基于 cimbar 动态彩色码协议的离线文件接收工具。通过摄像头扫描发送端屏幕的动画码完成文件传输，无需网络、无需配对。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen is an offline file receiver built on the cimbar animated color-code protocol. Scan the animated code on the sender's screen with your camera to transfer files — no network, no pairing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解码完成: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decoding complete: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解码完成: %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decoding complete: %@ (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解码模式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decode Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解码模式需与发送端一致，cimbar.org 当前默认为标准 Mode B；切换模式会重置正在进行的扫码。1080p 采集可提高远距/大屏识别率，但更耗电。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The decode mode must match the sender's — cimbar.org currently defaults to standard Mode B. Switching modes resets any scan in progress. 1080p capture improves recognition at longer distances and on large screens, but uses more battery."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解码遇到异常，已自动恢复，请继续保持取景": {
      "localizations": {
