            "value": "Full License Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用基于 libcimbar 源码实现 cimbar 解码，并包含少量适配 iOS 的修改（接收端 C 接口的小幅扩展）。修改后的源文件依 MPL-2.0 同样以源代码形式提供，可通过 App Store 页面的支持渠道获取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app implements cimbar decoding from the libcimbar sources, with small iOS adaptations (minor extensions to the receiver C interface). Per MPL-2.0, the modified source files are likewise available in source form via the support channel on the App Store page."
          }
        }
      }
    }
